* user: jesse.pinkman, vulnerable: DontReqPreauth (AS-REP Roasting), ACE: ForceChangePassword (from skyler.white)
* DC: 192.168.122.10 (polaris.local)

NEXT USEFUL CONTEXT FOR PLANNER:
* Exploitation of AS-REP roasting on jesse.pinkman or targeting the constrained delegation on walter.white are viable next steps.
